<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>excavation_long</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.7">excavation_long.sdf</sdf>
  <description>
    Excavation pit with two hidden regions: interior x [0, 14], y [5, 35], z [-10, 0], surrounded by a z = 0 apron, no columns
    or beams. A: a collapse on the left wall, reaching the surface, screens a 6.5 m wide pocket (y 11.5-18.5) that opens only towards the far end; a
    partition inside leaves a 3 m gap by the wall into a back chamber, so the pocket turns a corner. B: a slab fallen from the
    right wall roofs a 6 m wide, 5 m high cave (y 23-31), closed at its near end and open only at y 31. A 4 m crossing (y 18.5-23) joins the lanes beside A and B. Takeoff at (10, 2).
  </description>
</model>
